    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Summary API provides a comprehensive overview of the current contents of a user's shopping cart. This endpoint allows consumers to retrieve real-time data about items in the cart, including product details and total pricing. Typically used by online retailers and developers integrating ecommerce functionalities, this API supports optimizing user experiences by offering insights into cart status. By leveraging this summary information, applications can enhance customer engagement and improve conversion rates.",
